+ *  what they meant.
+ *
+ *  The scan is a hand-rolled quote walk, not a regular expression. The old
+ *  pattern (`/'((?:[^']|'')*)'/`) backtracks through an alternation on every
+ *  literal, and on a literal of a few million characters the backtracking
+ *  stack runs out: `RangeError: Maximum call stack size exceeded` on input
+ *  a real CHAR value can produce (a 15M-character literal was enough). The
